<b>Saitama University Mutsumi Festival
</b>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPresented by the Mutsumi Festival Executive Committee

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:37.490
Proof 11
Science-types Fell in Love, 
So They Tried Getting Married.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.020
And you yourself will be an 
empty set filled with nothing.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:43.610
That is a truly stupid way to live.

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:45.370
<i>It's true.</i>

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:49.670
<i>Just like he said, I'm an empty person.</i>

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:50.560
<i>But...</i>

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:51.680
Kanade-san!

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.330
Shikijou-san!

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.570
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:00.380
It's fine! I mean, it's just 
that I arrived here too early.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.960
Thank you for inviting me today.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.350
It would have been better if I 
could have come the first day,

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.770
but I had a report I needed to submit.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.870
It's completely fine!

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.760
Well, shall we go?

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:13.820
Yeah.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.290
<i>But things are good like this.</i>

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:23.290
<i>Because living like this is all I can do.</i>

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.400
The data you requested.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:31.860
Much obliged.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.040
With this, everything is assembled.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.120
I don't know what you intend to use it for,

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.330
but I pray that it all goes well...

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:40.550
Yukimura-kun.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.560
As usual, that man likes to put on airs.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:53.530
Hey! Walk a little slower!

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.440
Oh! Sorry.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.760
Honestly, you're so inconsiderate!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.630
<i>Oh, honestly! I yelled at him again!</i>

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:06.980
<i>And when I have this chance to go around 
the festival with Taniguchi-kun, too.</i>

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.950
<i>Oh, no. You can tell that they seem 
like bad types just by looking.</i>

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.170
<i>What do I do if they come up to me?</i>

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.820
<i>But I have Taniguchi-kun 
with me right now, so...</i>

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:21.500
Thanks for waiting!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.720
<b>Doner Kebab</b>

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.720
<b>Mild Sauce
Mixed Sauce
Hot Sauce</b>

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:22.420
Thank you!

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:23.720
Huh?

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.660
Hey! What are you doing?

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.940
Oh. Sorry.

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:31.220
Why do you always go at your own pace?

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:35.840
It's just that I spotted the kebabs that 
you like, so I couldn't help myself.

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:42.240
Honestly! If you're going off to buy 
something, just tell me! G-Got it?

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:45.990
Yeah. I'll be more careful next time.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.450
They can't be honest with their feelings...

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:56.140
a couple that's more than friends, 
but not sweethearts either.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.500
My material gathering is going very well.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:05.660
That aside, this festival atmosphere...

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.700
it's so nostalgic!

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.760
I'm glad it's as bustling as ever!

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:16.270
<b>505 Ikeda Laboratory</b>

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:16.270
<b>Romance Research
Cosplay
Experience</b>

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.960
This year, the Ikeda Lab's main 
event is a cosplay experiment.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:17.540
This is my chance to take 
ideal reference photos!

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.400
I can't let it slip away!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.980
Hello!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.800
Welcome, mademoiselle!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:27.790
Welcome to the Ikeda Lab's 
cosplay research room.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:31.250
Wow... Kosuke-san?

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.790
Today, you're quite... marvelous, aren't you?

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:35.850
Thanks.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:38.040
This is the cosplay of my spirit.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:43.760
To one day be dressed like this 
as I marry Aika is my dream!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:47.290
R-Really? I hope your dream comes true.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.020
Welcome!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:53.050
If you'd like, you're welcome 
to whatever cosplay you'd like!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:57.060
Wow! I can wear any of them?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:57.940
Yes!

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:03.070
And in exchange, we ask that you please fill 
out this cosplay attractiveness scale!

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:03.070
<b>Ikeda Laboratory</b>

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:09.200
Cosplay Experience -Attractiveness Measured by Sense of Sight-

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:09.200
15. Appeal which comes from a different dimension.
 14. Appeal which goes beyond spacetime.
 13. Appeal which matches the scale of the cosmos.
 12. Milky Way-level appeal.
 11. Appeal which makes you feel you've witnessed a miracle.
 10. Goddess-like appeal.
 9. Overwhelmingly appealing.
 8. Extremely appealing.
 7. Very appealing.
 6. Appealing.
 5. Somewhat Appealing.
 4. Couldn't say either way.
 3. Somewhat unappealing.
 2. Unappealing.
